"
I am a phlow action target for search actions that apply to the text selected in a coder.
Actions defined on {{gtClass:GtCoderSelectionSearch}} with me as target are shown in the coder context menu, in the `Search` submenu.
"
Class {
	#name : #GtCoderSelectionSearchTarget,
	#superclass : #GtPhlowActionUniqueTarget,
	#category : #'GToolkit-Pharo-Coder-Method-UI-Search'
}
